WEBVTT

00:05.839 --> 00:08.174
TOKYO REVENGERS

01:38.681 --> 01:39.516
Yuzuha...

01:40.642 --> 01:43.394
I will kill you.

02:04.374 --> 02:05.625
Don't, Taiju!

02:22.725 --> 02:23.601
Yuzuha...

02:26.855 --> 02:27.730
Damn it!

02:30.358 --> 02:31.943
Get hold of yourself, Taiju!

02:32.026 --> 02:34.112
Out of the way, you dumb brat.

02:34.195 --> 02:35.363
Takemitchy!

02:35.446 --> 02:41.327
You claim you care for your family,
but you're the one who's destroying it.

02:41.411 --> 02:43.413
Don't! He'll kill you.

02:43.496 --> 02:45.790
What's your problem, Hakkai?

02:46.374 --> 02:47.667
What're you afraid of?

02:48.501 --> 02:50.336
Your sister's going to get killed.

02:51.337 --> 02:53.464
Aren't you going to protect her?

02:57.635 --> 03:00.013
They're the ones...

03:01.139 --> 03:03.016
who tried to kill me first.

03:03.558 --> 03:04.434
Holy shit!

03:08.062 --> 03:09.898
<i>I thought I was going to die.</i>

03:10.899 --> 03:11.733
<i>Damn it!</i>

03:13.067 --> 03:16.321
How does a family fight
escalate into murder?

03:16.404 --> 03:17.906
This is insane.

03:24.621 --> 03:25.455
Hanagaki.

03:26.039 --> 03:30.251
This is the path we siblings...

03:31.169 --> 03:32.295
chose.

03:37.133 --> 03:40.511
I protected Yuzuha this whole time.

03:42.096 --> 03:43.264
<i>I get it now.</i>

03:43.348 --> 03:45.183
<i>The key is Yuzuha.</i>

03:46.059 --> 03:50.313
<i>In the original timeline,
it was Yuzuha who killed Taiju.</i>

03:51.314 --> 03:54.692
<i>Even so, the story now
is that Hakkai killed him.</i>

03:57.946 --> 04:00.782
<i>Yuzuha killed Taiju
after Kisaki incited her to.</i>

04:01.407 --> 04:03.451
<i>Hakkai covered for her.</i>

04:04.160 --> 04:08.539
<i>Since Kisaki knew the truth,
he was able to control Hakkai.</i>

04:09.040 --> 04:12.835
<i>Then, he took over BLACK DRAGON
and corrupted Toman.</i>

04:13.461 --> 04:16.297
<i>It's all because he was protecting Yuzuha.</i>

04:18.925 --> 04:21.427
I know what I have to do now, Hakkai.

04:21.511 --> 04:22.345
What?

04:26.766 --> 04:28.142
Kick Taiju's ass!

04:29.102 --> 04:32.313
<i>If Yuzuha is protected,
Hakkai won't be corrupted.</i>

04:33.314 --> 04:37.402
Takemitchy, there's no way you'll ever...

04:38.319 --> 04:41.489
You have no idea how dangerous he is.

04:44.742 --> 04:46.703
Stay out of this, Hanagaki.

04:48.579 --> 04:49.414
Yuzuha.

04:51.291 --> 04:55.086
I will... protect Hakkai.

05:00.174 --> 05:01.551
I will...

05:02.802 --> 05:04.679
protect him.

05:11.477 --> 05:14.147
This isn't what you use
when protecting someone.

05:18.776 --> 05:19.819
What?

05:20.403 --> 05:21.362
Mitsuya?

05:23.865 --> 05:26.242
Taka...

05:27.076 --> 05:28.828
Let go of it, Yuzuha.

05:29.620 --> 05:31.164
You're cutting my hand.

05:40.923 --> 05:41.799
Mitsuya...

05:48.181 --> 05:49.849
<i>What's Mitsuya doing here?</i>

05:50.433 --> 05:51.267
Takemitchy.

05:52.769 --> 05:54.103
Look after Yuzuha.

05:54.187 --> 05:55.063
Sure.

05:59.942 --> 06:00.985
Okay.

06:02.779 --> 06:04.906
You're fighting me now, bastard.

06:07.450 --> 06:10.119
What? Are you nuts?

06:10.953 --> 06:13.081
What about the truce?

06:13.748 --> 06:16.626
Don't tell me you're the kind of scum

06:16.709 --> 06:19.087
who breaks a promise
that you made yourself.

06:19.170 --> 06:20.046
Go to hell.

06:22.298 --> 06:23.925
Forget that promise.

06:24.550 --> 06:26.344
Let me tell you something obvious.

06:27.053 --> 06:30.223
You never strike your younger sister,
no matter what.

06:31.057 --> 06:33.518
No matter her mischief,
you laugh it off and forgive.

06:34.977 --> 06:37.230
That's what a big brother does,
you bastard.

06:39.899 --> 06:41.234
Hey, Draken.

06:41.317 --> 06:42.151
Yeah?

06:42.652 --> 06:45.363
Did you hear Mitsuya's Impulse just now?

06:45.446 --> 06:50.868
What? The only moron who'd ride
in this freezing cold is you.

06:50.952 --> 06:52.078
You're hearing things.

06:52.161 --> 06:54.414
Yeah, maybe you're right.

06:54.497 --> 06:59.919
Let's hurry up and get back home.
It's dangerous with the snow piling up.

07:00.002 --> 07:02.630
What? Don't tell me you're afraid.

07:02.713 --> 07:07.385
What? I told you it's freaking freezing.
My face hurts too.

07:07.969 --> 07:09.762
Don't drive so fast!

07:14.016 --> 07:15.017
Bring it on!

07:49.343 --> 07:51.596
Mitsuya's incredible.

07:53.848 --> 07:57.018
<i>He's matching that beast punch for punch.</i>

07:58.311 --> 08:01.105
What're you just standing
there for, Takemitchy?

08:02.023 --> 08:03.274
Chifuyu.

08:04.484 --> 08:06.110
You're okay, Chifuyu?

08:06.194 --> 08:08.237
Well, not exactly.

08:08.321 --> 08:13.367
After Kisaki and Hanma betrayed me
and tied me up, Mitsuya rescued me.

08:13.451 --> 08:14.827
Mitsuya did?

08:26.506 --> 08:28.925
But why'd Mitsuya show up here?

08:29.008 --> 08:29.967
I called him.

08:30.051 --> 08:30.885
Really?

08:30.968 --> 08:33.346
We can't let Kisaki outwit us.

08:33.429 --> 08:34.555
Outwit us?

08:35.306 --> 08:37.475
Wait! What about the truce?

08:38.059 --> 08:40.311
That truce has nothing to do with us.

08:40.853 --> 08:45.608
Our objective is to remove BLACK DRAGON
from Toman's future.

08:45.691 --> 08:46.817
Yeah, but...

08:46.901 --> 08:49.278
Mitsuya arranged the truce.

08:49.862 --> 08:52.073
If he breaks it, everyone will understand.

08:55.034 --> 08:55.868
Taka!

08:58.996 --> 09:00.915
What's wrong, Mitsuya?

09:01.415 --> 09:05.127
I've only been fighting at 70%.

09:05.211 --> 09:06.170
What?

09:07.338 --> 09:09.840
Quit acting like you're winning this.

09:11.008 --> 09:13.719
A strap just came loose on my boots.

09:15.263 --> 09:17.557
Stop, Taka! It's no good.

09:17.640 --> 09:19.141
You'll never defeat Taiju.

09:25.940 --> 09:27.942
You're smarter than this.

09:28.025 --> 09:30.486
You'd never fight such a hopeless battle.

09:53.384 --> 09:55.761
Taka, it's hopeless.

09:55.845 --> 09:58.514
He's bigger, older,
and more powerful than you.

09:58.598 --> 10:01.684
You don't have anything
working in your favor.

10:03.060 --> 10:04.895
Shut up for a second, Hakkai.

10:04.979 --> 10:05.813
What?

10:05.896 --> 10:07.523
Don't you get it?

10:09.859 --> 10:11.360
He's being stubborn.

10:12.028 --> 10:13.654
Because you're watching.

10:16.699 --> 10:19.952
Mitsuya's smart,
and he can calculate how it'll go.

10:20.536 --> 10:22.913
He's well aware of the risks.

10:22.997 --> 10:26.459
He's doing it for you,
the younger brother.

10:33.674 --> 10:34.592
<i>Taka...</i>

10:35.718 --> 10:37.720
Mitsuya won't lose.

10:37.803 --> 10:40.181
That's right. He sure as heck won't.

10:47.605 --> 10:49.732
You're one tough bastard.

10:53.277 --> 10:55.488
I'm getting tired,

10:55.571 --> 10:57.573
so it's time to finish this.

10:58.658 --> 10:59.575
Right...

11:00.951 --> 11:01.911
Inui?

11:02.912 --> 11:04.080
Death whack.

11:22.139 --> 11:25.434
Taka!

11:31.899 --> 11:34.860
What'd you think of my information?

11:35.569 --> 11:37.822
It was worth 100 grand, wasn't it?

11:40.574 --> 11:42.910
Taka! Taka!

11:42.993 --> 11:44.370
What'll we do, Takemitchy?

11:44.453 --> 11:46.288
Taka's not moving.

11:47.957 --> 11:49.250
Of course, he isn't.

11:50.000 --> 11:51.585
I clobbered him with all my might.

11:55.005 --> 11:56.298
Nice work, Inui.

11:56.382 --> 11:58.968
Go on and kill the rest of them!

12:01.470 --> 12:05.099
-You've done it now, you bastard!
-You've done it now, you bastard!

12:07.727 --> 12:10.688
Bring it on, you stupid punks!

12:11.188 --> 12:12.356
-BLACK DRAGON!
-BLACK DRAGON!

12:12.940 --> 12:15.401
You're going down!

12:19.113 --> 12:20.114
Stop, you two!

12:21.907 --> 12:23.159
Mitsuya.

12:23.701 --> 12:25.161
I'm fine.

12:29.123 --> 12:30.916
So just chill out.

12:32.710 --> 12:35.129
Taka. Don't push yourself.

12:40.301 --> 12:42.470
Takemitchy. Chifuyu.

12:43.512 --> 12:45.181
Calm down and listen.

12:45.264 --> 12:46.098
-Okay.
-Okay.

12:46.182 --> 12:48.434
The situation is desperate.

12:49.101 --> 12:50.686
Taiju's a monster.

12:51.228 --> 12:54.231
And those other two
will use any means at their disposal.

12:54.774 --> 12:56.525
In comparison,

12:57.234 --> 13:01.197
Chifuyu's all beat up,
and to be honest, I can't move.

13:01.781 --> 13:04.617
Takemitchy's the only one in good shape.

13:06.494 --> 13:10.206
But if we lose now,
Yuzuha will go through hell again.

13:10.998 --> 13:12.666
She might even get killed.

13:13.250 --> 13:14.585
It'll be fine.

13:15.044 --> 13:15.878
What?

13:15.961 --> 13:17.963
Mikey and the others will come.

13:18.756 --> 13:20.508
We just have to hold out until then.

13:21.217 --> 13:23.344
When they get here, it'll all work out.

13:26.388 --> 13:27.723
Takemitchy,

13:28.432 --> 13:30.643
you mean you called Mikey?

13:30.726 --> 13:33.646
What? Didn't you call him, Mitsuya?

13:34.271 --> 13:37.066
I came alone to help Hakkai.

13:37.733 --> 13:39.235
This doesn't involve Toman.

13:39.735 --> 13:41.237
It's a personal issue.

13:42.613 --> 13:44.698
The three of us will protect Yuzuha.

13:45.741 --> 13:47.034
<i>We're dead.</i>

13:48.619 --> 13:49.453
<i>It's over.</i>

13:50.788 --> 13:52.998
<i>We don't stand a chance.</i>

13:53.999 --> 13:56.710
<i>I had a glimmer of hope
when Mitsuya showed up.</i>

13:57.253 --> 13:59.421
<i>I figured Toman was on the way,</i>

13:59.505 --> 14:01.757
<i>and we just had to last until then.</i>

14:02.591 --> 14:04.260
Get up, Takemitchy.

14:05.052 --> 14:06.595
I got my hopes up too.

14:07.221 --> 14:08.472
But now that it's come to this,

14:09.056 --> 14:11.183
we'll just have to handle it ourselves.

14:11.267 --> 14:13.853
There's no way we can.

14:13.936 --> 14:16.146
I'm the only one in decent shape.

14:16.230 --> 14:20.401
-Are you telling me to fight those three?
-Hey, man. How long we got to wait?

14:20.484 --> 14:22.444
There's no way.

14:24.405 --> 14:25.364
Takemitchy.

14:26.282 --> 14:29.159
I'm not putting all this on you.

14:30.452 --> 14:34.331
If you and Chifuyu can keep
those other two out of the way,

14:34.915 --> 14:36.625
I'll handle Taiju.

14:36.709 --> 14:40.254
Not in your condition.
There's no way you can, Mitsuya.

14:40.337 --> 14:42.965
Yeah, I can't do it alone.

14:44.633 --> 14:47.177
You'll help out. Won't you, Hakkai?

14:51.473 --> 14:53.976
You're a member of BLACK DRAGON now,

14:54.894 --> 14:57.229
so you're not in a position
to work with us.

14:58.105 --> 15:01.859
But to protect Yuzuha, your own sister,

15:01.942 --> 15:04.403
lend us a hand, Hakkai!

15:06.572 --> 15:07.406
I...

15:08.782 --> 15:09.617
I...

15:10.743 --> 15:12.703
I know you're scared of Taiju.

15:13.370 --> 15:15.039
You could never defy him.

15:17.124 --> 15:19.752
But even so, until now,

15:19.835 --> 15:22.588
you've always protected Yuzuha, right?

15:26.383 --> 15:27.384
Don't worry.

15:27.885 --> 15:30.012
You can overcome Taiju.

15:30.596 --> 15:31.430
Taka...

15:32.473 --> 15:33.724
You've got it wrong.

15:33.807 --> 15:36.226
You'll do it. Right, Hakkai?

15:45.194 --> 15:46.654
Sorry for wimping out.

15:46.737 --> 15:48.113
I feel pathetic.

15:49.198 --> 15:50.407
It's no surprise,

15:50.908 --> 15:52.493
considering the situation.

15:55.120 --> 15:56.455
Let's go, Takemitchy.

15:57.122 --> 15:58.040
Right.

15:58.123 --> 15:59.500
Don't overdo it, Chifuyu.

16:00.042 --> 16:01.168
You're in bad shape.

16:01.794 --> 16:04.213
I'll take the guy who hit Mitsuya.

16:04.296 --> 16:06.382
You take the 100-grand guy.

16:06.882 --> 16:08.926
Looks like they've gained the courage.

16:09.009 --> 16:09.843
Got it.

16:10.386 --> 16:13.597
The black-haired guy
sold information on Taiju for money.

16:13.681 --> 16:16.725
He'll probably back off
if he sees he's losing.

16:17.267 --> 16:19.353
Right. I agree.

16:19.937 --> 16:22.690
Just hold on
until Mitsuya and Hakkai defeat Taiju.

16:22.773 --> 16:23.774
Ready?

16:23.857 --> 16:24.775
Yeah.

16:24.858 --> 16:25.818
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

16:33.158 --> 16:36.078
It's been a while
since the two of us fought together.

16:37.371 --> 16:39.248
Well, Hakkai?

16:44.211 --> 16:47.464
Don't tell me you're going to defy me.

16:49.466 --> 16:50.968
It's all right.

16:52.094 --> 16:54.054
You're tougher than Taiju.

17:01.895 --> 17:03.188
Damn!

17:07.401 --> 17:10.779
Hey, you plan on holding onto me
like that the whole time?

17:11.363 --> 17:15.409
<i>It's all I can do to just hold him back.
Chifuyu's already in bad shape.</i>

17:16.660 --> 17:18.287
Mitsuya! Hakkai!

17:18.370 --> 17:20.706
We can't hold out that long. Hurry!

17:21.707 --> 17:24.460
I see. You're buying time, huh?

17:27.921 --> 17:31.633
You'll be fine, Hakkai.
I know you can defeat Taiju.

17:32.342 --> 17:33.302
Have confidence.

17:35.345 --> 17:37.097
Let's go, Hakkai!

17:42.394 --> 17:43.312
Hakkai?

17:46.899 --> 17:47.733
I'm sorry...

17:49.651 --> 17:50.486
Taka.

17:55.866 --> 17:57.409
Mitsuya.

17:58.077 --> 18:01.371
What were you expecting from Hakkai?

18:05.334 --> 18:06.210
Mitsuya!

18:12.382 --> 18:13.467
Chifuyu Matsuno.

18:14.384 --> 18:17.387
I wanted to fight you
when you were in better shape.

18:29.274 --> 18:30.234
Damn it...

18:37.282 --> 18:40.202
Taiju!

18:45.040 --> 18:46.375
Even I...

18:46.458 --> 18:49.711
Even I can do this!

18:57.928 --> 18:59.555
Out of my way, Takemitchy!

18:59.638 --> 19:01.140
I'm going kill...

19:03.142 --> 19:04.560
Don't you get it, Hakkai?

19:05.727 --> 19:07.354
If you do this,

19:08.605 --> 19:10.691
you'll end up being hopeless scum.

19:12.109 --> 19:15.487
You know that
this isn't how to fight back.

19:29.168 --> 19:31.420
I'll show you what it means...

19:32.671 --> 19:33.964
to fight back.

19:37.092 --> 19:37.926
What?

19:38.552 --> 19:40.971
You still haven't learned
your lesson, punk?

19:43.807 --> 19:47.519
You came to help
even though you knew you'd lose.

19:48.020 --> 19:49.938
Haven't learned my lesson, have I?

19:51.565 --> 19:53.901
That's my only redeeming quality.

19:56.695 --> 19:58.155
Here I come, Taiju.

20:00.866 --> 20:01.992
Takemitchy!

20:04.870 --> 20:07.748
I'm not done yet.

20:28.018 --> 20:32.648
How many times do I got to punch you
until you're satisfied?

20:39.655 --> 20:41.156
I won't lose.

20:44.993 --> 20:46.370
I won't lose...

20:47.704 --> 20:48.538
Why?

20:49.498 --> 20:52.793
Why do you try so hard
when you're so weak?

20:53.502 --> 20:56.380
That's enough! Cut this out already!

21:06.098 --> 21:08.684
That's enough, Takemitchy.

21:09.851 --> 21:11.019
You've done...

21:12.145 --> 21:12.980
your very best.

21:14.564 --> 21:16.233
We've lost.

21:28.370 --> 21:31.039
I wanted to give this to you.

21:34.042 --> 21:34.876
This is...

21:36.169 --> 21:37.713
the same as the one I gave you.

21:41.466 --> 21:42.926
We should match, right?

21:45.304 --> 21:46.138
<i>Hina...</i>

21:47.389 --> 21:50.183
<i>Give me courage.</i>

21:52.436 --> 21:57.190
<i>Because of his brother
and because there's BLACK DRAGON,</i>

21:58.191 --> 21:59.985
<i>Hakkai can't stand up and fight.</i>

22:01.236 --> 22:02.321
<i>Then...</i>

22:05.240 --> 22:06.074
Taiju,

22:06.700 --> 22:08.118
I'm going to defeat you

22:09.036 --> 22:10.579
and take over BLACK DRAGON.

22:15.667 --> 22:16.835
Takemitchy!

23:38.375 --> 23:40.377
Translation by Brian Athey
